{'symbol': 'DTE', 'date': '2019-10-18 08:30:00', 'title': 'DTE MIDSTREAM, A NON-UTILITY BUSINESS OF DTE ENERGY, EXPANDS GROWTH PLATFORM WITH ACQUISITION OF HIGH-QUALITY MIDSTREAM ASSETS', 'text': "DTE MIDSTREAM, A NON-UTILITY BUSINESS OF DTE ENERGY, EXPANDS GROWTH PLATFORM WITH ACQUISITION OF HIGH-QUALITY MIDSTREAM ASSETS.DTE ENERGY CO - DEAL FOR $2.25 BILLION IN CASH.DTE ENERGY CO - WILL ACQUIRE 100 PERCENT OF ASSETS FROM MOMENTUM MIDSTREAM AND INDIGO NATURAL RESOURCES.DTE ENERGY CO - TO ALSO PAY $400 MILLION MILESTONE PAYMENT UPON COMPLETION OF GATHERING PIPELINE IN H2 2020.DTE ENERGY CO - ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE A GATHERING SYSTEM AND GATHERING PIPELINE IN HAYNESVILLE SHALE FORMATION OF LOUISIANA.DTE ENERGY CO - TRANSACTION, AT A PROJECT LEVEL, IS IMMEDIATELY $0.15 ACCRETIVE TO OPERATING EPS IN 2020.DTE ENERGY CO - DTE REAFFIRMS COMMITMENT TO LONG-TERM BUSINESS MIX OF 70-75% UTILITY.DTE ENERGY CO - TRANSACTION HAS BEEN APPROVED BY DTE ENERGY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS."}